1
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:03,462
[uplifting music]

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:06,423
[Lloyd] I take it you
got the same message?

3
00:00:06,423 --> 00:00:07,883
From Master Wu?

4
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:10,219
Saying there'd be
special training today?

5
00:00:10,219 --> 00:00:11,845
Yeah, we heard the same thing.

6
00:00:12,888 --> 00:00:15,891
[Zane] I see you received
Master Wu's message
as well, Jay.

7
00:00:15,891 --> 00:00:18,894
Uh, totally.
I wasn't playing
video games for so long,

8
00:00:18,894 --> 00:00:20,729
my legs went numb
and I needed a walk.

9
00:00:20,729 --> 00:00:23,106
That message, which
I absolutely got,

10
00:00:23,106 --> 00:00:25,526
is definitely why I'm here.

11
00:00:25,526 --> 00:00:29,655
Excellent. It is time
for an important lesson.

12
00:00:29,655 --> 00:00:32,533
Today, we are going to dance.

13
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:34,243
[group groans]

14
00:00:34,243 --> 00:00:36,787
Not more "Spin Harmony."

15
00:00:36,787 --> 00:00:38,830
Come on, Master Wu,
you know I ran away

16
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:41,834
from that dancing school my
dad put me in when I was a kid.

17
00:00:41,834 --> 00:00:45,838
Focus. Just like a warrior,
a dancer is completely

18
00:00:45,838 --> 00:00:47,923
in tune with their body.

19
00:00:47,923 --> 00:00:51,927
Dance will only improve
your fighting skills.

20
00:00:51,927 --> 00:00:54,930
Plus, you might have
fun in the process.

21
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,100
-[record player clicks]
-[gentle waltz music]

22
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:02,563
Now, follow me. One, two,
three, one, two, three.

23
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:05,524
[gentle waltz music continues]

24
00:01:05,524 --> 00:01:07,442
May I have this dance?

25
00:01:07,442 --> 00:01:08,443
[chuckles] Sure.

26
00:01:09,945 --> 00:01:13,365
[gentle waltz music continues]

27
00:01:13,365 --> 00:01:16,451
I will love you forever, Nya.

28
00:01:16,451 --> 00:01:17,578
[ominous music]

29
00:01:17,578 --> 00:01:20,372
Jay! Jay!

30
00:01:20,372 --> 00:01:22,165
Whoop!

31
00:01:22,165 --> 00:01:24,543
[Ninja grunts]

32
00:01:24,543 --> 00:01:25,544
Jay!

33
00:01:26,628 --> 00:01:27,796
[Nya gasps]

34
00:01:28,881 --> 00:01:30,924
[giggles]
Jay!

35
00:01:31,884 --> 00:01:34,595
♪ Lost in the unknown
So much to see ♪

36
00:01:34,595 --> 00:01:37,681
♪ Together we will rise ♪

37
00:01:37,681 --> 00:01:40,767
♪ We fight ♪

38
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:45,189
♪ Be a ninja for what's right ♪

39
00:01:45,189 --> 00:01:46,607
[flame roaring]

40
00:01:48,692 --> 00:01:51,236
[calm music]

41
00:01:51,528 --> 00:01:53,488
Lloyd, I saw Jay.

42
00:01:53,488 --> 00:01:55,157
What? Where?

43
00:01:55,157 --> 00:01:58,368
He went south, but I lost
him in the crowd. Come on!

44
00:02:00,412 --> 00:02:03,457
[powerful music]

45
00:02:04,041 --> 00:02:07,252
-[people chattering]
-Did he see you?

46
00:02:07,252 --> 00:02:11,840
No, and I didn't see his
face, but I'm sure it was him.

47
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,926
I think. I don't know.

48
00:02:13,926 --> 00:02:15,844
Maybe I'm just seeing things.

49
00:02:15,844 --> 00:02:17,846
Jay's been missing
since the Merge.

50
00:02:17,846 --> 00:02:19,181
I miss him so much.

51
00:02:20,182 --> 00:02:21,183
We all do.

52
00:02:22,267 --> 00:02:25,896
[calm music continues]

53
00:02:25,896 --> 00:02:27,439
I know Zant-Tanz.

54
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:30,192
He doesn't have a cruel bone
in his body!

55
00:02:30,192 --> 00:02:34,238
Actually, he doesn't have
any bones in his body,
but that's not the point.

56
00:02:34,238 --> 00:02:36,031
I don't believe he was
behind those attacks,

57
00:02:36,031 --> 00:02:38,116
either, but who was?

58
00:02:38,116 --> 00:02:41,662
My guess, the same
person who's responsible

59
00:02:41,662 --> 00:02:43,497
for attacking the Matriarch,

60
00:02:43,497 --> 00:02:47,125
and his name rhymes with "paws."

61
00:02:47,125 --> 00:02:48,752
Ras, I'm talking about Ras.

62
00:02:48,752 --> 00:02:50,546
Yeah, I gathered that,

63
00:02:50,546 --> 00:02:52,756
but Ras was also
attacked last night.

64
00:02:52,756 --> 00:02:57,010
Right. Man, this whole
mystery-solving stuff is hard.

65
00:02:57,010 --> 00:02:59,304
My parents were so good at it!

66
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:01,682
They'd probably solve
this thing in a day.

67
00:03:01,682 --> 00:03:03,100
Have you asked the
other Ninja for help?

68
00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:06,353
No, Lloyd made this my mission.

69
00:03:06,353 --> 00:03:08,063
If I can't compete
in the tournament,

70
00:03:08,063 --> 00:03:11,650
I'm determined to prove myself
by solving this mystery.

71
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:14,570
The safety of the Source
Dragons is at stake here.

72
00:03:14,570 --> 00:03:19,199
-Come on, Riyu, time to
hunt for some clues.
-[Riyu grunts]

73
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:22,077
You're not the only ones with
a mystery to solve today.

74
00:03:22,661 --> 00:03:26,039
In all these mystery books,
your dad and I are
always reading,

75
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,958
the first thing a detective does

76
00:03:27,958 --> 00:03:31,128
is retrace the steps
of everyone involved.

77
00:03:31,128 --> 00:03:32,546
Why do you think they do that?

78
00:03:32,546 --> 00:03:35,048
'Cause it might lead to clues,

79
00:03:35,048 --> 00:03:38,218
-to help the detective
solve the case?
-That's right!

80
00:03:38,218 --> 00:03:42,556
Look at you, already a great
little detective, Arin.

81
00:03:42,556 --> 00:03:45,267
[Riyu sniffing]

82
00:03:45,267 --> 00:03:48,437
The attacker must've come
through here last night, Riyu.

83
00:03:48,437 --> 00:03:50,856
We need to try and
retrace that bot's steps.

84
00:03:50,856 --> 00:03:53,066
-[Riyu squawks]
-[gasps] You find something?

85
00:03:53,066 --> 00:03:55,652
[Riyu continues
sniffing, squawks]

86
00:03:55,652 --> 00:03:58,071
You found the same
scent as last night?

87
00:03:58,071 --> 00:04:01,074
If we can figure out where
the attacker came from,

88
00:04:01,074 --> 00:04:03,118
maybe we can figure out
who sent them.

89
00:04:04,036 --> 00:04:08,624
-[Riyu continues sniffing]
-[dramatic music]

90
00:04:08,624 --> 00:04:10,459
-[Riyu squawks]
-Dead end.

91
00:04:10,459 --> 00:04:15,047
Wait. Some kind of symbol
scratched into the wall.

92
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:18,383
I wonder if this is a clue
to whoever sent the bot?

93
00:04:18,383 --> 00:04:19,510
Let me copy it down.

94
00:04:21,845 --> 00:04:24,097
Arin! What are you up to?

95
00:04:24,097 --> 00:04:26,099
Oh, Frak, hey!

96
00:04:26,099 --> 00:04:28,769
Riyu and I were
just, uh, well...

97
00:04:28,769 --> 00:04:31,104
[chuckles] It's complicated
Ninja business, really.

98
00:04:31,104 --> 00:04:33,357
[laughs] Do you
know how cool it is

99
00:04:33,357 --> 00:04:35,234
you get to say stuff like that?

100
00:04:35,234 --> 00:04:36,860
My master's been
training me hard,

101
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:38,987
but I'm taking a break
to grab a pie.

102
00:04:38,987 --> 00:04:41,865
-Interested?
-[Riyu's stomach gurgling]

103
00:04:41,865 --> 00:04:45,744
I might know a dragon who'd
be up for a pie or ten.

104
00:04:45,744 --> 00:04:46,745
Let's go!

105
00:04:48,247 --> 00:04:51,041
[bright music]

106
00:04:53,126 --> 00:04:55,796
-[wondrous music]
-[Riyu slurping]

107
00:04:55,796 --> 00:04:57,422
[Frak] I can't believe
what that Zant-Tanz guy

108
00:04:57,422 --> 00:04:58,966
tried to pull last night.

109
00:04:58,966 --> 00:05:02,845
-Attacker bots? Scary, right?
-[Riyu growling]

110
00:05:02,845 --> 00:05:05,138
I don't think Zant-Tanz
was behind it.

111
00:05:05,138 --> 00:05:06,765
He's not the aggressive type.

112
00:05:06,765 --> 00:05:09,142
The guy's frightened by
sharp corners on tables.

113
00:05:09,142 --> 00:05:11,103
But no one else
could have done it.

114
00:05:12,062 --> 00:05:13,522
[Riyu sniffing]

115
00:05:13,522 --> 00:05:16,733
-[Riyu growls]
-So, you gotta tell me,

116
00:05:16,733 --> 00:05:18,193
how did you hook
up with the Ninja?

117
00:05:18,193 --> 00:05:19,903
And do you freak out
about it every day?

118
00:05:19,903 --> 00:05:21,864
Oh, pretty much.

119
00:05:21,864 --> 00:05:23,782
Sora and I met Lloyd
while we were trying

120
00:05:23,782 --> 00:05:26,159
to save Riyu here
from dragon hunters.

121
00:05:26,159 --> 00:05:30,163
It's been a dream come true,
but it's also a lot of work.

122
00:05:30,163 --> 00:05:31,748
Training can be hard.

123
00:05:31,748 --> 00:05:34,376
Tell me about it.
You have to meet my master.

124
00:05:34,376 --> 00:05:37,129
I was so clueless and
scared by my powers,

125
00:05:37,129 --> 00:05:38,213
and he really helped me out.

126
00:05:38,213 --> 00:05:39,631
He sounds awesome.

127
00:05:40,465 --> 00:05:44,344
-[calm music]
-Wyldfyre?

128
00:05:44,344 --> 00:05:47,306
Oh, hey, Arin, [laughs]
didn't see you there.

129
00:05:47,306 --> 00:05:50,475
I'm just doing some mental
exercises on my own,

130
00:05:50,475 --> 00:05:53,270
definitely not looking
for someone or anything.

131
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,272
This whole tournament
is tight, Uncle.

132
00:05:55,272 --> 00:05:57,024
You're a control freak.

133
00:05:57,024 --> 00:06:02,821
Your idea of control is
chaos, Roby. I don't like it.

134
00:06:03,363 --> 00:06:07,492
Oh! [giggling] Hi, Roby.

135
00:06:08,452 --> 00:06:10,871
I was just wandering
here randomly,

136
00:06:10,871 --> 00:06:13,665
doing my own thing and not
looking for you at all,

137
00:06:13,665 --> 00:06:17,294
but since I'm seeing you now,
I just wanted to say

138
00:06:17,294 --> 00:06:21,006
I can't wait to help make
your tournament a success.

139
00:06:21,006 --> 00:06:25,135
Oh, thanks. Uh,
Wyldfyre, isn't it?

140
00:06:25,135 --> 00:06:28,222
[gasps] That's my name.
It's a dragon name.

141
00:06:28,222 --> 00:06:30,557
I was raised by dragons,
but I'm not a dragon,
as you can see.

142
00:06:30,557 --> 00:06:32,768
Why am I still talking?
Stop talking.

143
00:06:32,768 --> 00:06:35,437
My uncle and I were, uh,
just about to check out

144
00:06:35,437 --> 00:06:38,232
the games plaza before
the first event.

145
00:06:38,232 --> 00:06:39,399
Wanna come with?

146
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:41,068
Yes, definitely!

147
00:06:41,068 --> 00:06:43,737
I mean, I have a lot of
other things I could do,

148
00:06:43,737 --> 00:06:45,614
but they can wait, let's go!

149
00:06:45,614 --> 00:06:49,368
Am I reading into things
a bit too much here?

150
00:06:49,368 --> 00:06:51,578
That that girl has
a huge crush on Roby?

151
00:06:51,578 --> 00:06:54,414
She might as well
be wearing a T-shirt
that says "I heart Roby."

152
00:06:54,414 --> 00:06:57,251
Having a crush is
the most normal thing
I've ever seen her do.

153
00:06:57,251 --> 00:07:00,212
Hey, I better head off to
meet my team. Check ya later?

154
00:07:00,212 --> 00:07:02,464
Oh, definitely!
Go compete!

155
00:07:02,464 --> 00:07:04,299
[melancholy music]

156
00:07:04,299 --> 00:07:07,803
[sighs] Must be nice having
a power to compete with.

157
00:07:07,803 --> 00:07:10,180
[Riyu sighs and grumbles]

158
00:07:10,180 --> 00:07:13,141
[whimsical music]

159
00:07:13,141 --> 00:07:14,476
[Cole] Hmm.

160
00:07:15,727 --> 00:07:17,604
-Huh?
-Huh?

161
00:07:17,604 --> 00:07:19,356
Geo? What?

162
00:07:19,356 --> 00:07:20,357
You're here?

163
00:07:21,525 --> 00:07:24,111
My tournament invite
showed up after you left.

164
00:07:24,111 --> 00:07:26,905
I figured you'd wind up
here, too, so I came.

165
00:07:26,905 --> 00:07:28,323
This is amazing!

166
00:07:28,323 --> 00:07:29,616
Come on,
I'm checking out the city

167
00:07:29,616 --> 00:07:31,535
before the competition starts.

168
00:07:31,535 --> 00:07:34,288
[dramatic music]

169
00:07:36,582 --> 00:07:37,875
Whoa!

170
00:07:40,294 --> 00:07:43,005
Check it out, apparently
this mech belonged

171
00:07:43,005 --> 00:07:45,757
to a past Elemental
Master of Earth.

172
00:07:45,757 --> 00:07:47,217
Someone you knew?

173
00:07:47,217 --> 00:07:49,344
Huh, Elemental
Powers are usually

174
00:07:49,344 --> 00:07:50,846
passed down from parents.

175
00:07:50,846 --> 00:07:52,347
I got mine from my mom.

176
00:07:52,347 --> 00:07:55,184
Maybe this was hers. Wow.

177
00:07:55,184 --> 00:07:57,811
[dramatic music]

178
00:08:00,981 --> 00:08:03,525
[furtive music]

179
00:08:12,284 --> 00:08:16,622
[ominous music]

180
00:08:16,622 --> 00:08:19,666
Last night at the banquet,
why did you ask me for my help?

181
00:08:19,666 --> 00:08:22,294
What are you talking about?
I did no such thing.

182
00:08:23,504 --> 00:08:26,381
But you did. How could
you not remember it?

183
00:08:26,381 --> 00:08:28,300
If you think playing mind games

184
00:08:28,300 --> 00:08:30,427
is going to help you
Ninja win the tournament,

185
00:08:30,427 --> 00:08:33,764
you're about to be
proven brutally wrong.

186
00:08:33,764 --> 00:08:36,141
[ominous music]

187
00:08:38,810 --> 00:08:42,272
I saw that.
Does she suspect something?

188
00:08:45,817 --> 00:08:48,987
I don't know.
We must be careful.

189
00:08:49,655 --> 00:08:51,823
What are you up to, Jordana?

190
00:08:51,823 --> 00:08:53,450
[mysterious music]

191
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:55,911
Frak? He's with them?

192
00:08:55,911 --> 00:08:58,997
[sinister music]

193
00:08:58,997 --> 00:09:01,542
[Ninjas grunting]

194
00:09:01,542 --> 00:09:04,461
[calm music]

195
00:09:04,461 --> 00:09:06,797
[panting] Arin! You're
not gonna believe this.

196
00:09:06,797 --> 00:09:09,216
That they have
Merlopian Cream pies here?

197
00:09:09,216 --> 00:09:11,051
I know! I had three of them!

198
00:09:11,051 --> 00:09:12,719
What? No!

199
00:09:12,719 --> 00:09:15,806
Your old friend, Frak,
he's on Ras' team.

200
00:09:15,806 --> 00:09:18,350
No way, that can't be true.

201
00:09:18,350 --> 00:09:20,435
I saw it with my own eyes.

202
00:09:20,435 --> 00:09:21,854
[Riyu growling]

203
00:09:21,854 --> 00:09:25,774
You think so too, Riyu?
But Frak is a great guy!

204
00:09:25,774 --> 00:09:27,985
You must've seen something
else and got confused.

205
00:09:27,985 --> 00:09:30,779
I didn't. And I wouldn't
lie to you, Arin.

206
00:09:31,572 --> 00:09:33,657
We better head over
to the games plaza.

207
00:09:33,657 --> 00:09:35,617
First event's
coming up, and Roby,

208
00:09:35,617 --> 00:09:38,495
trying to make everything
as "exciting as possible,"

209
00:09:38,495 --> 00:09:41,790
won't tell anyone
who's competing until
the event itself.

210
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:44,543
-[Arin and Sora sighing]
-[Riyu growls]

211
00:09:44,543 --> 00:09:47,171
[calm music]

212
00:09:49,298 --> 00:09:52,467
[ominous music]

213
00:09:55,095 --> 00:09:58,599
[Zarkt] Why the delay?
What's taking so long?

214
00:09:58,599 --> 00:10:00,601
[sinister music]

215
00:10:00,601 --> 00:10:02,936
My patience is wearing thin.

216
00:10:04,563 --> 00:10:06,315
[suspenseful music]

217
00:10:06,315 --> 00:10:08,525
You know how one of the
five made it out of here,

218
00:10:08,525 --> 00:10:10,777
but we've only ever
seen three in here?

219
00:10:10,777 --> 00:10:12,946
Guess that sleeping one
is the last of them.

220
00:10:12,946 --> 00:10:14,990
[Bonzle] Sounds like
they're talking to someone.

221
00:10:14,990 --> 00:10:17,201
But who? And how?

222
00:10:17,201 --> 00:10:19,620
Make haste.
The sooner we are free,

223
00:10:19,620 --> 00:10:23,040
the sooner our brutal
dominance can continue.

224
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:25,501
[ominous music]

225
00:10:27,294 --> 00:10:30,172
They found a way to talk
to someone on the outside
who could free them?

226
00:10:30,172 --> 00:10:31,965
We gotta check it out.

227
00:10:31,965 --> 00:10:34,092
[powerful music]

228
00:10:34,092 --> 00:10:36,762
-[bright music]
-Hey, hey, looking
good, looking good!

229
00:10:36,762 --> 00:10:39,431
All engagement is
good engagement.

230
00:10:39,431 --> 00:10:43,644
All right, bubbles!
Remember, play to the crowds.

231
00:10:43,644 --> 00:10:46,772
The tournament is
and always has been

232
00:10:46,772 --> 00:10:49,900
about the honor of
Elemental Battle.

233
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:52,319
It is not "hot."

234
00:10:52,319 --> 00:10:53,654
You're not hot.

235
00:10:53,654 --> 00:10:56,657
This is not how
your father ran it.

236
00:10:56,657 --> 00:10:58,659
That's the point.

237
00:10:58,659 --> 00:11:00,869
Hi again, Roby! Hi!

238
00:11:00,869 --> 00:11:03,205
[whimsical music]

239
00:11:03,205 --> 00:11:04,748
-[Cinder grunts]
-[Wyldfyre] Oh!

240
00:11:04,748 --> 00:11:06,333
Oops. Sorry.

241
00:11:06,333 --> 00:11:07,960
[Wyldfyre] That was
on purpose, Cinder!

242
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,671
So? What are you
gonna do about it?

243
00:11:10,671 --> 00:11:13,173
You and your little
Ninja friends gonna cry?

244
00:11:13,173 --> 00:11:17,678
Keep talking and you'll be
the one crying, tears of fire!

245
00:11:17,678 --> 00:11:20,472
Hey, hey, hey! Calm it down!

246
00:11:20,472 --> 00:11:22,307
-[Wyldfyre growls]
-Tournament rules, remember?

247
00:11:22,307 --> 00:11:25,143
Any battle outside the games
will lead to expulsion!

248
00:11:26,228 --> 00:11:27,688
[Wyldfyre growls]

249
00:11:28,897 --> 00:11:30,148
[Wyldfyre grunts]

250
00:11:30,941 --> 00:11:32,609
[dramatic music]

251
00:11:32,609 --> 00:11:35,696
Remember, we aren't here
just to win.

252
00:11:35,696 --> 00:11:37,447
We're competing
'cause we believe

253
00:11:37,447 --> 00:11:39,700
whoever's threatening the
Source Dragons is here to win

254
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:42,494
and gain control of
all Elemental Powers.

255
00:11:42,494 --> 00:11:46,248
The fate of the entire
Merged Lands is in our hands.

256
00:11:46,248 --> 00:11:47,916
Yeah, you should all just use

257
00:11:47,916 --> 00:11:50,127
Rising Dragon technique
from the start.

258
00:11:50,127 --> 00:11:51,628
Plow through everyone.

259
00:11:51,628 --> 00:11:55,007
No, Wyldfyre, this is a
Tournament of Elements.

260
00:11:55,007 --> 00:11:57,134
Rising Dragon comes
from Spinjitzu

261
00:11:57,134 --> 00:11:59,553
and should only be
used to defend oneself.

262
00:11:59,553 --> 00:12:01,972
Like if Ras' team
uses Shatterspin?

263
00:12:01,972 --> 00:12:04,057
Exactly, the Motion
Source Dragon

264
00:12:04,057 --> 00:12:05,726
wanted us to compete honorably,

265
00:12:05,726 --> 00:12:07,728
and that's what we're gonna do.

266
00:12:07,728 --> 00:12:09,521
[inspiring music]

267
00:12:09,521 --> 00:12:12,357
[all] Ninja, go!

268
00:12:12,357 --> 00:12:14,484
Welcome, all you peeps
to the starting event

269
00:12:14,484 --> 00:12:18,572
of the first Roby-Certified
Tournament of the Sources.

270
00:12:18,572 --> 00:12:20,741
And this first game, we're
kicking it old-school.

271
00:12:20,741 --> 00:12:22,326
[crowd cheering]

272
00:12:22,326 --> 00:12:25,495
One-on-one, arena combat,
no holds barred!

273
00:12:25,495 --> 00:12:29,750
In the grand tradition of the
Tournament of the Sources,

274
00:12:29,750 --> 00:12:32,836
honor and sportsmanship are
our--

275
00:12:32,836 --> 00:12:36,298
Ugh, you're making this sound
like boring old-school,
Uncle Bleckt, listen.

276
00:12:36,298 --> 00:12:38,675
Our first competitor
is cold as ice

277
00:12:38,675 --> 00:12:44,806
but computes twice as nice,
Zane, the Titanium Ninja!

278
00:12:44,806 --> 00:12:47,893
-Come on, Zane. You got this.
-You can do it!

279
00:12:47,893 --> 00:12:51,688
Facing off against Zane,
he's dark, mysterious,

280
00:12:51,688 --> 00:12:57,694
and oh-so-dangerous, the
Master of Reflex himself, Zur!

281
00:12:57,694 --> 00:12:58,862
[crowd cheering]

282
00:12:58,862 --> 00:13:01,031
I am limber. I am loose.

283
00:13:02,533 --> 00:13:06,161
-[Zur whooshing]
-I am in trouble.

284
00:13:06,161 --> 00:13:07,955
[Lloyd] Don't worry, Zane!

285
00:13:07,955 --> 00:13:11,667
He's got fast reflexes, but
ice can slow down anything!

286
00:13:12,501 --> 00:13:15,337
Honored guests and Masters!

287
00:13:15,337 --> 00:13:18,799
Who's ready for the
epicness to begin?

288
00:13:18,799 --> 00:13:19,883
-Yeah!
-[bell clangs]

289
00:13:19,883 --> 00:13:21,844
[crowd cheering and applauding]

290
00:13:21,844 --> 00:13:26,807
-[dramatic music]
-[competitors grunting]

291
00:13:27,599 --> 00:13:30,310
[beams hissing]

292
00:13:30,310 --> 00:13:31,728
-[ice crunches]
-[fist thuds]

293
00:13:31,728 --> 00:13:34,147
-[crowd cheering]
-[suspenseful music]

294
00:13:34,147 --> 00:13:36,567
-[Zur thuds]
-[beam hisses]

295
00:13:36,567 --> 00:13:37,651
-Ooh!
-Ooh!

296
00:13:37,651 --> 00:13:40,529
[suspenseful music]

297
00:13:42,823 --> 00:13:44,741
[Zane roars]

298
00:13:44,741 --> 00:13:46,743
[dramatic music]

299
00:13:46,743 --> 00:13:48,787
-[Zane shouts]
-[crowd cheering and applauding]

300
00:13:48,787 --> 00:13:52,207
We have a victor! Zur wins!

301
00:13:52,207 --> 00:13:55,961
What an incredible battle!
Intense!

302
00:13:56,837 --> 00:14:00,007
Time for the first
Elemental Transition!

303
00:14:00,007 --> 00:14:04,011
Behold, the Element Cup!
Now, Zane, if you would.

304
00:14:04,011 --> 00:14:06,763
-[beam sizzling]
-[dramatic music]

305
00:14:06,763 --> 00:14:08,891
Like every game that
has gone before,

306
00:14:08,891 --> 00:14:11,310
the winner gets the Elemental
Power of the defeated

307
00:14:11,310 --> 00:14:13,896
to carry into their
next competition.

308
00:14:15,397 --> 00:14:18,859
[triumphant music]

309
00:14:18,859 --> 00:14:21,904
[crowd cheering and applauding]

310
00:14:24,489 --> 00:14:28,952
Did Zane's ice melt
unnaturally quickly?
Looked quick to me.

311
00:14:28,952 --> 00:14:31,413
Told you ya shoulda
used Rising Dragon.

312
00:14:31,413 --> 00:14:33,790
Maybe Wyldfyre's right.

313
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:37,711
She is not. Your
leadership is sound, Lloyd.

314
00:14:37,711 --> 00:14:41,757
It is not the Ninja way
to use excessive force
to fight unfairly.

315
00:14:41,757 --> 00:14:45,594
That was a noble battle
that I unfortunately lost,

316
00:14:45,594 --> 00:14:47,804
putting our mission in jeopardy.

317
00:14:47,804 --> 00:14:50,724
Now I can only spectate
until my powers return

318
00:14:50,724 --> 00:14:52,434
after the final game.

319
00:14:52,434 --> 00:14:54,144
You did the best
you could, Zane.

320
00:14:54,144 --> 00:14:56,855
No one said this
was gonna be easy.

321
00:14:56,855 --> 00:14:58,815
I wonder who's up next?

322
00:14:58,815 --> 00:15:01,068
Please welcome to the arena,

323
00:15:01,068 --> 00:15:06,406
she's slick, she's cool,
and she's well-hydrated!

324
00:15:06,406 --> 00:15:09,618
Nya, Elemental Master of Water!

325
00:15:09,618 --> 00:15:11,203
I had to ask.

326
00:15:12,037 --> 00:15:17,209
Get psyched, Nya.
Ready to go, ready to win.

327
00:15:17,209 --> 00:15:19,837
Looks like Ras might be
coaching your opponent.

328
00:15:19,837 --> 00:15:22,381
Whoever it is, I can take 'em.

329
00:15:22,381 --> 00:15:26,134
[suspenseful music continues]

330
00:15:27,386 --> 00:15:28,554
Jay?

331
00:15:28,554 --> 00:15:30,848
[dramatic music]

332
00:15:30,848 --> 00:15:35,853
The most shocking competitor
in the tournament,

333
00:15:35,853 --> 00:15:39,940
Jay Walker, Elemental
Master of Lightning!

334
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:42,401
-[lightning sizzling]
-[dramatic music]

335
00:15:42,401 --> 00:15:44,403
[crowd cheering and applauding]

336
00:15:44,403 --> 00:15:47,865
[dramatic music continues]

337
00:15:47,865 --> 00:15:50,325
Jay! I knew I saw you.

338
00:15:50,325 --> 00:15:51,869
What are you talking about?

339
00:15:51,869 --> 00:15:55,414
I've never seen you
before in my life.

340
00:15:55,414 --> 00:15:57,958
Jay could never forget
Nya, or any of us!

341
00:15:57,958 --> 00:16:00,878
Is that some kind of fake Jay?
Some loser in a Jay wig?

342
00:16:00,878 --> 00:16:02,212
We don't know what
happened to Jay

343
00:16:02,212 --> 00:16:04,631
after he disappeared
in the Merge.

344
00:16:04,631 --> 00:16:06,550
[suspenseful music]

345
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:09,887
I knew the Ninja would
never see this coming.

346
00:16:09,887 --> 00:16:12,848
[mysterious music]

347
00:16:14,725 --> 00:16:16,894
[dramatic music]

348
00:16:16,894 --> 00:16:19,479
It's time now for--

349
00:16:19,479 --> 00:16:21,982
[tower clanking]

350
00:16:21,982 --> 00:16:23,901
The Tower Battle!

351
00:16:23,901 --> 00:16:25,485
The first to reach
the top of the tower

352
00:16:25,485 --> 00:16:28,155
and get that glorious
blinged-out dagger

353
00:16:28,155 --> 00:16:31,408
will be hey-o, winner!

354
00:16:31,408 --> 00:16:33,076
[crowd cheering and applauding]

355
00:16:33,076 --> 00:16:35,913
[dramatic music]

356
00:16:35,913 --> 00:16:38,498
Lloyd, I can't fight him!

357
00:16:38,498 --> 00:16:39,875
I don't think we have a choice.

358
00:16:41,543 --> 00:16:43,045
[bell clangs]

359
00:16:44,213 --> 00:16:46,798
Jay! It's me, Nya!

360
00:16:46,798 --> 00:16:50,427
Is that supposed to mean
something to me, lady? Hiya!

361
00:16:50,427 --> 00:16:51,845
-Ooh!
-[Nya thuds]

362
00:16:51,845 --> 00:16:53,180
-[team gasps]
-[crowd cheers]

363
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:54,181
[panting] Jay!

364
00:16:55,182 --> 00:16:58,852
[competitors grunting]

365
00:16:58,852 --> 00:17:01,230
Nya, focus on the dagger!

366
00:17:01,230 --> 00:17:03,732
[suspenseful music]

367
00:17:03,732 --> 00:17:04,942
[Jay grunting]

368
00:17:04,942 --> 00:17:07,402
Jay!

369
00:17:07,402 --> 00:17:09,947
You had a clear shot
and didn't take it!

370
00:17:09,947 --> 00:17:11,949
Are you a terrible Ninja?

371
00:17:11,949 --> 00:17:15,953
I don't wanna hurt you.
We care too much for each other!

372
00:17:15,953 --> 00:17:19,248
Speak for yourself, lady.
Ooh-ah!

373
00:17:19,248 --> 00:17:21,083
-[Jay grunting]
-Oh, look out!

374
00:17:21,083 --> 00:17:23,669
My Master, Ras, told
me you'd lie to me,

375
00:17:23,669 --> 00:17:25,712
try to use mind games on me.

376
00:17:25,712 --> 00:17:27,422
You won't shake my confidence!

377
00:17:27,422 --> 00:17:28,966
I don't believe a word you say!

378
00:17:28,966 --> 00:17:31,969
[grunts] Ras is
the one lying to you!

379
00:17:31,969 --> 00:17:34,471
You're a Ninja who
disappeared after the Merge!

380
00:17:36,223 --> 00:17:39,017
Jay, you're the love of my life.

381
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:42,771
Ugh, as if! Ras
told me the truth.

382
00:17:42,771 --> 00:17:44,356
I was a great warrior,

383
00:17:44,356 --> 00:17:47,401
fighting alongside my
Master in the Wyldness.

384
00:17:47,401 --> 00:17:49,903
When the Merge happened,
I lost my memory

385
00:17:49,903 --> 00:17:52,990
and ended up in some place
called The Administration.

386
00:17:52,990 --> 00:17:54,700
[mysterious music]

387
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:59,538
The Administration?
Jay is Agent Walker?

388
00:17:59,538 --> 00:18:01,081
[dramatic music]

389
00:18:01,081 --> 00:18:02,249
-[both grunting]
-[fists thudding]

390
00:18:02,249 --> 00:18:03,667
I escaped from there.

391
00:18:03,667 --> 00:18:06,253
Then Lord Ras found me
and rescued me!

392
00:18:06,253 --> 00:18:08,046
[Nya grunts]

393
00:18:08,046 --> 00:18:12,801
I owe it to Ras to win this
tournament, whatever it takes.

394
00:18:12,801 --> 00:18:15,554
Jay, no! Don't do that!

395
00:18:15,554 --> 00:18:17,222
[ominous music]

396
00:18:17,222 --> 00:18:19,224
He's gonna shatter his goodness!

397
00:18:19,224 --> 00:18:22,019
I'm afraid he already has.

398
00:18:22,019 --> 00:18:24,855
[ominous music continues]

399
00:18:24,855 --> 00:18:27,149
[gong clangs]

400
00:18:27,149 --> 00:18:28,942
[dramatic music]

401
00:18:28,942 --> 00:18:33,030
-[crowd cheering]
-Ooh-ah!

402
00:18:33,030 --> 00:18:36,074
-[fist thuds]
-[Nya grunts and thuds]

403
00:18:36,074 --> 00:18:37,618
-[foot thuds]
-[Nya thuds]

404
00:18:37,618 --> 00:18:39,494
[dramatic music]

405
00:18:43,332 --> 00:18:46,043
You don't leave me
any choice, Jay.

406
00:18:46,043 --> 00:18:48,795
[inspiring music]

407
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:56,053
[triumphant music]

408
00:18:56,053 --> 00:18:58,305
-[Jay shouts]
-[crowd cheering and applauding]

409
00:18:58,305 --> 00:19:00,307
-Wow!
-Whoo-hoo!

410
00:19:00,307 --> 00:19:03,894
Wow, didn't a super-smart
and good-looking Ninja here

411
00:19:03,894 --> 00:19:07,439
say Rising Dragon
technique would be epic?

412
00:19:07,439 --> 00:19:10,400
[triumphant music]

413
00:19:19,326 --> 00:19:23,330
[crowd cheering and applauding]

414
00:19:23,330 --> 00:19:26,667
[triumphant music continues]

415
00:19:26,667 --> 00:19:28,544
-Yes!
-Whoo-hoo!

416
00:19:28,544 --> 00:19:29,586
[Ras growls]

417
00:19:29,586 --> 00:19:31,630
[triumphant music continues]

418
00:19:31,630 --> 00:19:36,093
We have a winner!
Nya, Master of Water!

419
00:19:36,093 --> 00:19:38,887
Woot-woot! Spa-lash!

420
00:19:38,887 --> 00:19:43,684
-[tower clanking]
-[triumphant music continues]

421
00:19:43,684 --> 00:19:46,103
[beam sizzles]

422
00:19:46,103 --> 00:19:47,521
[crowd cheering and applauding]

423
00:19:47,521 --> 00:19:49,106
The thrills keep coming!

424
00:19:49,106 --> 00:19:51,233
Jay is now without
his Elemental Powers,

425
00:19:51,233 --> 00:19:54,361
and Nya now controls
water and lightning!

426
00:19:54,361 --> 00:19:56,613
Show us, Nya!

427
00:19:56,613 --> 00:20:00,284
[triumphant music continues]

428
00:20:04,079 --> 00:20:07,583
-[calm music]
-[crowd cheering]

429
00:20:07,583 --> 00:20:11,086
I didn't rescue you so you
could disappoint me, Jay.

430
00:20:11,086 --> 00:20:13,088
I do not tolerate failure.

431
00:20:13,088 --> 00:20:15,257
I'm sorry, Lord Ras.

432
00:20:15,257 --> 00:20:18,343
Sorry is not good enough.

433
00:20:18,343 --> 00:20:20,095
[calm music continues]

434
00:20:20,095 --> 00:20:23,932
She won. We're doing what the
Source Dragon asked of us.

435
00:20:23,932 --> 00:20:26,143
So why does this
just feel empty?

436
00:20:26,143 --> 00:20:30,272
Because we might have won
the match, but we lost Jay.

437
00:20:30,272 --> 00:20:32,691
Jay, I know you
lost your memory,

438
00:20:32,691 --> 00:20:34,693
but you need to know the truth.

439
00:20:35,694 --> 00:20:39,698
I love you.
I will always love you.

440
00:20:39,698 --> 00:20:42,743
And I will always hate you.

441
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:45,996
[mysterious music]

442
00:20:47,122 --> 00:20:49,249
[Ras growls]

443
00:20:50,709 --> 00:20:52,044
[Roby whooshes]

444
00:20:55,130 --> 00:20:56,256
[eerie music]

445
00:20:56,256 --> 00:20:59,301
Is she asleep, or...

446
00:21:03,597 --> 00:21:07,100
She's breathing, but she's
totally out of it or something.

447
00:21:07,935 --> 00:21:10,229
Hello? Boo!

448
00:21:10,229 --> 00:21:12,189
Nope, she's out.

449
00:21:12,189 --> 00:21:13,690
What is that? Lint?

450
00:21:13,690 --> 00:21:17,653
Huh, must be scales from Riyu,

451
00:21:17,653 --> 00:21:20,781
from when he tried to keep me
from getting sucked
into the portal.

452
00:21:20,781 --> 00:21:22,824
[liquid bubbling]

453
00:21:22,824 --> 00:21:26,203
Those scales, you have
a physical connection

454
00:21:26,203 --> 00:21:28,497
to someone outside of here.

455
00:21:28,497 --> 00:21:30,916
Maybe we can
communicate with Riyu.

456
00:21:31,458 --> 00:21:33,752
[eerie music]

457
00:21:33,752 --> 00:21:37,923
[fireworks booming
and whistling]

458
00:21:37,923 --> 00:21:38,966
[Kai] Riyu?

459
00:21:38,966 --> 00:21:40,384
[Riyu whimpers]

460
00:21:40,384 --> 00:21:42,219
[Kai]
Riyu, can you hear us?

461
00:21:42,219 --> 00:21:46,348
-It's Kai and Bonzle. Hello?
-[Riyu squawks]

462
00:21:46,348 --> 00:21:48,141
[dramatic music]

